//! `SpecialtyManager` (`Core/Managers/World/SpecialtyManager.cs`): trade-pack (specialty)
//! prices, the per zone group trade rates (`_priceRatios`, consumed by sold packs and
//! regenerated by timers), selling packs at specialty NPCs, and the specialty packets
//! (`CSSellBackpackGoods`, `CSSpecialtyRatio`, `CSListSpecialtyGoods`,
//! `CSRequestSpecialtyCurrent`; `CSBuySpecialtyItem` / `CSSpecialtyRecordLoad` are not in the
//! 1.2 opcode table and stay unregistered as in C#).
//!
//! Item template fields the C# reads (`ItemTemplate.Refund`, `SpecialtyZoneId`,
//! `ItemManager.GetAllItems()` order) are loaded here from `items` / `item_backpacks`; mails,
//! consuming the pack and labor go through `hooks::EconomyBridge`.

